<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30365" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nānus</span></b> , i, m., =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάννος</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νᾶνος</span> (cf. <i><span class="en">Gell. 19, 13, 2 sq.</span></i>); in vulg. lang.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a dwarf</i>
			(pure Lat. pumilio): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">interrogatum a quodam nano,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Tib. 61</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Prop.
				4</span></i> (5), 8, 41; <i><span class="en">Juv. 8,
			32</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			In <i>fem.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nāna</span></b> , ae, <i>a
				female dwarf</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nanos et nanas et moriones populo donavit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lampr. Alex. Sev. 34</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A small horse</i>, Helv. Cinn. ap. <i><span class="en">Gell. 19,
				13, 5</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">id. ib.</span></i> §
			4.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A low, shallow water-vessel</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vas aquarium vocant futim ... quo postea
					accessit nanus cum Graeco nomine, et cum Latino nomine,
					Graecā figurā barbatus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 119</span></i>
			 Müll.; cf. Paul. ex <i><span class="en">Fest. p.
				176</span></i> ib.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
